    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A duck was blessed with magical powers and has to save the world from evil creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight waves of enemies in an arena with auto-firing staffs. And customise your spells in between waves by buying cards with effects such as &quot;split on hit&quot; or &quot;swirl&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380900/extras/c6be4915ae08443b7d9ec2adfb9e927f.poster.avif?t=1750792744\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380900/extras/c6be4915ae08443b7d9ec2adfb9e927f.webm?t=1750792744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380900/extras/c6be4915ae08443b7d9ec2adfb9e927f.mp4?t=1750792744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Snowball</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snowball into an unstoppable force in the late game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380900/extras/2dcfbf424dcc98a1dda0763f6a95017a.poster.avif?t=1750792744\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380900/extras/2dcfbf424dcc98a1dda0763f6a95017a.webm?t=1750792744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380900/extras/2dcfbf424dcc98a1dda0763f6a95017a.mp4?t=1750792744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlockables</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides meta-progression upgrades, the game also features unlockable ducks with their own stats so you can further strategize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380900/extras/6901982443b016429f2ea4aad2fc5d1e.avif?t=1750792744\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hordes of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different stages with unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tinker with your spells in between waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize:\u00a0Will you go for an all powerful blast, or rapidfire projectiles?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get permanent upgrades after each run (meta-progression)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different ducks with their own stats and/or abilities</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A duck was blessed with magical powers and has to save the world from evil creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight waves of enemies in an arena with auto-firing staffs. And customise your spells in between waves by buying cards with effects such as &quot;split on hit&quot; or &quot;swirl&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380900/extras/c6be4915ae08443b7d9ec2adfb9e927f.poster.avif?t=1750792744\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380900/extras/c6be4915ae08443b7d9ec2adfb9e927f.webm?t=1750792744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380900/extras/c6be4915ae08443b7d9ec2adfb9e927f.mp4?t=1750792744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Snowball</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snowball into an unstoppable force in the late game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380900/extras/2dcfbf424dcc98a1dda0763f6a95017a.poster.avif?t=1750792744\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380900/extras/2dcfbf424dcc98a1dda0763f6a95017a.webm?t=1750792744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380900/extras/2dcfbf424dcc98a1dda0763f6a95017a.mp4?t=1750792744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlockables</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides meta-progression upgrades, the game also features unlockable ducks with their own stats so you can further strategize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380900/extras/6901982443b016429f2ea4aad2fc5d1e.avif?t=1750792744\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hordes of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different stages with unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tinker with your spells in between waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize:\u00a0Will you go for an all powerful blast, or rapidfire projectiles?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get permanent upgrades after each run (meta-progression)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different ducks with their own stats and/or abilities</p></li></ul>",
